1
00:00:00,101 --> 00:00:01,232
You chug a soda

2
00:00:01,232 --> 00:00:02,411
on a first date...

3
00:00:02,411 --> 00:00:02,953
and—

4
00:00:03,633 --> 00:00:04,767
Smooth.

5
00:00:04,810 --> 00:00:05,386
Your throat

6
00:00:05,386 --> 00:00:07,081
just slammed a door...

7
00:00:07,081 --> 00:00:08,367
on your own breath.

8
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,110
Fizz swells your stomach,

9
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:10,519
poking your

10
00:00:10,519 --> 00:00:11,633
breathing muscle.

11
00:00:11,680 --> 00:00:12,878
It JERKS...

12
00:00:12,878 --> 00:00:14,030
and your vocal cords

13
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:15,490
snap SHUT.

14
00:00:15,490 --> 00:00:16,633
Air hits the door.

15
00:00:17,323 --> 00:00:18,671
Subscribe...

16
00:00:18,671 --> 00:00:20,300
it gets slimy.

17
00:00:20,338 --> 00:00:20,965
Why?

18
00:00:20,965 --> 00:00:21,762
One idea:

19
00:00:21,762 --> 00:00:23,933
we got it from tadpoles.

20
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:24,740
They gulp water

21
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:25,860
for their gills...

22
00:00:25,860 --> 00:00:27,380
with that same door

23
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:28,433
shut.

24
00:00:28,464 --> 00:00:30,360
So you're not nervous.

25
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,477
You're...

26
00:00:31,477 --> 00:00:33,045
part tadpole.

